    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">neuroticism</rdfs:label><obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A personality trait, in the Big Five taxonomy, characterising a tendency toward negative emotionality and emotional instability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
